flowchart TD
    UI[Client Advisor Workspace - Six scenarios] --> API[Same-origin API - Input validation]
    API --> CONTACT{Contact allowed?}
    CONTACT -->|No| STOP[Three internal abstention notes - No model call]
    CONTACT -->|Yes| MODE{Generation mode}
    MODE -->|Sample| FIXTURE[Fixture matching and format checks - Generic fallback]
    MODE -->|Live| AGENT[Bounded Drafting Agent - Server key and system rules]
    AGENT --> OPENAI[OpenAI Responses API - GPT-6.1 Sol]
    OPENAI --> CHECK[Output schema and limited text checks]
    CHECK -->|Valid| DRAFT[Three drafts - Provenance and attempt trace]
    CHECK -->|First failure| REPAIR[Validation feedback - At most one repair]
    REPAIR --> AGENT
    CHECK -->|Second failure| ERROR[Visible error - No sample fallback]
    OPENAI -->|Provider or schema error| ERROR
    FIXTURE -->|Valid sample| DRAFT
    FIXTURE -->|Invalid sample| ERROR
    STOP --> UI
    DRAFT --> UI
    ERROR --> UI
    DRAFT --> HUMAN[Advisor review and editing - No automatic sending]
    DRAFT --> EXPORT[Local JSON export]
    DATA[50 frozen test inputs] --> RUNNER[Evaluation harness]
    RUNNER --> API
    RUNNER --> RECORD[Versioned results - Snapshots and hashes]
